<title>USA: IBJ Schroder new unit names Fanning CEO.</title>
<headline>IBJ Schroder new unit names Fanning CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBJ Schroder Bank &amp; Trust Co said on Tuesday that its newly formed IBJ Schroder Business Credit Corp unit named Edward Fanning as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>IBJ Schroder Bank is itself owned by Industrial Bank of Japan Ltd.</p>
<p>Ronald Winters was named chief operating officer of the new Business Credit Corp asset-based and equipment finance subsidiary.</p>
</text>
